## INSTRUCTIONS

Carefully read the full transcript above. Then complete all three tasks below.

For each extracted value, assign a confidence level:
- HIGH = clearly and explicitly stated in the transcript
- LOW = implied or inferred from context
- UNCERTAIN = ambiguous, conflicting, or mentioned but unclear

Use NOT_MENTIONED if the information was not discussed at all.

CRITICAL RULE: Only extract information that was explicitly confirmed by the CLIENT. The fact that the advisor asked about a topic does NOT mean the client has it. Do not infer, assume, or fabricate assets, goals, liabilities, or any other details that were not directly stated by the client in their own words. When in doubt, use NOT_MENTIONED.

