## TASK 2 - ADVISOR NARRATIVE

Write a professional 3-5 sentence narrative summary in the style of a UK wealth management advisor case notes. Use third person. Cover: client profile, employment and income, key financial goals, attitude to risk, ESG preferences, and any notable circumstances. This will be stored on the client record.

NARRATIVE: [your narrative here]

